Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=18}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They left Garp on Pirate Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The article says he went there\Nto rescue some guy named Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess he succeeded.\NToo bad it cost him his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.14,Main-207+,Woop Slap,0,0,0,,[WOOP SLAP]\NWhere does it say he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man's a living legend.\NThis isn't how he's gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wipe those looks off your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.27,Main-207+,Makino,0,0,0,,[MAKINO]\NYou're right. I'm sure he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn right he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[baby laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's laughing? You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[baby crying]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:39.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was just the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Makino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Garp too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that what you were laughing at?\NYou know Luffy's face now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We love Luffy. Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those idiots thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, we got a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.33,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,[MAN]\NIt's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.55,Main-207+,Men,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MEN]\N– It's a tsunami!\N– It's a tsunami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get to high ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow me! We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:52.52,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe earthquake on that day\Nwas unlike any other in recorded history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:56.98,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,It caused devastating damage\Nall around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:09.66,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,[MAN]\NRun for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:22.05,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NARRATOR]\NThe situation was highly unusual.\NThe earthquake's epicenter could not be detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:24.47,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,The truth was hidden from the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:28.85,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,But it was no coincidence that the tragedy\Noccurred six days after the Kingdom of Lulusia
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:32.31,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,was wiped off the map\Nby the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:33.86,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,[MAN]\NI'm at the remains of Lulusia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:36.32,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no trace of the land anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:38.90,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just a giant hole swallowing up the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.07,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,No further approach is possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:43.54,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,The hole isn't filling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:52.39,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NARRATOR]\NAcross the entire world, sea levels rose by\Napproximately one meter following the havoc of the earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The beach has never flooded like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[loud crash]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, there won't\Nbe any beach left here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:05.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the tide pulling back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running on the beach is our favorite pastime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't glamorous at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:21.53,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NA number of beaches\Nhave disappeared from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.03,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,along with several islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.70,Main-207+,Woman,0,0,0,,[WOMAN]\NThere's nothing left for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:31.66,Main-207+,Woman,0,0,0,,We have to go! Sharks\Nswam right into my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.83,Main-207+,Man 1,0,0,0,,[MAN 1]\NIt's not supposed to be high tide yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.84,Main-207+,Man 2,0,0,0,,[MAN 2]\NMight make for a big catch, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.09,Main-207+,Man 3,0,0,0,,[MAN 3]\NYou really want\Nto go sailing in this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.38,Main-207+,Man 1,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MAN 1]\NSir, an update\Non the flooding situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[thunder rumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:48.89,Main-207+,Man 2,0,0,0,,[MAN 2]\NSea levels are rising\Naround the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:50.43,Main-207+,Man 1,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MAN 1]\NYes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.31,Main-207+,Man 1,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the cause is unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.90,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NMeanwhile, Egghead.\Nwas surrounded by a fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:07:01.36,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,of 100 Navy vessels of various sizes,\Nincluding twenty massive battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:03.82,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,This was a force that could level a nation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:07.87,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,with power far exceeding\Neven that of a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:12.11,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,523)}The total number of Marines was 30,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:16.17,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\q2}And the leaders of this unprecedented operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[loud rustle of cape]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:25.05,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,were nine Navy HQ vice admirals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[pneumatic hiss]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[♪ heroic music plays]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:34.48,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,and Admiral Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:38.44,Main-207+,Man,0,0,0,,[MAN]\NWe're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you not to attack\Nthe Sea Beast Weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard you, but I'm afraid it attacked us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:26.74,Main-207+,Server,0,0,0,,[SERVER]\NYour meal, Kizaru, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:30.53,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,[KIZARU]\NOh! My favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:31.99,Main-207+,Server,0,0,0,,[SERVER]\NThere you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat it while it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:45.21,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\i1}[KIZARU]\NI gotta say, you're really putting me\Non the spot here, Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:49.88,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Why don't you just surrender\Nand have a nice bowl of ramen with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:53.22,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,{\i1}[SENTOMARU]\NGet serious.\NAttack again and we'll open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:55.72,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\i1}[KIZARU]\NOh, now you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:09:02.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You know what you're up against here?\NPunk developed the Pacifista's lasers by studying your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}you're{\i0} here to murder him.\NNever thought things would turn out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He studied the Void Century, Sentomaru.\NOld friend or not, I can't defend a crime like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm just the Navy's puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:25.92,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}[KIZARU]\NThat said, we don't want\Nto have this battle any more than you do. The more we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[growls angrily]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:28.92,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\i1}destroy, the more we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:33.26,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was really hoping Lucci would clean this up\Nquickly without trashing the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can thank the Straw Hats for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[♪ dramatic piano music]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:43.65,Main-207+,St. Jaygarcia,0,0,0,,[ST. JAYGARCIA]\NDon't let\Nanyone else know I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:44.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:50.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}"Straw Hats took Vegapunk hostage\Nand barricaded themselves inside."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like this article.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Morgan's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir, we haven't received word\Nthat CP0 has completed their mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru is prepared\Nto defend the island outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we can guess who's in the Labophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, we have Dr. Vegapunk, along\Nwith his six satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They should have the four Seraphim protecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then there's Straw Hat Luffy and his crew,\Nwho seem to have allied with the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:28.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Also, there's CP0's Rob Lucci, along\Nwith the others in his leading unit, Kaku and Stussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:33.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}As for the other Cipher Pol agents, they appear\Nto have been captured by Sentomaru and his Pacifistas
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the Fabriophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One added note. The Frontier Dome\Nbarrier status is currently at 100%,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:46.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,meaning that no one can enter\Nor leave the Labophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been like that for an entire day.\NWe still don't know what's going on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What happened to all the researches\Nand technicians who were employed on Egghead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not present.\NThey evacuated the island yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've already located their ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what if they know too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink them at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one more thing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We spotted Jewelry Bonney.\NShe may be there with the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma's daughter, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have no more use for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about her. She's just a girl. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? I'm trying to enjoy a meal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:39.41,Main-207+,Operator,0,0,0,,[OPERATOR]\NWe're picking up\Na signal from Egghead. A signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They seem to be making a call somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll find out who they're calling then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:49.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Marie Jois.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DenDenMushi ringing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral, you should have\Na black transponder snail on your wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! You can tap the call. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hello?! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}York!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you punky kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:24.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why the hell are you trying to kill me, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the one who told you what Stella did!\NRemember that, Peepaws?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:32.02,Main-207+,Elder,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ELDER]\NBe that as it may, you're still\Na Vegapunk, {\i0}just like the others{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:35.32,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,{\i1}[YORK]\NI don't give\Na shit about the Void Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And even if I did, you think I would have\Ntipped you off about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:41.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Use your brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did CP0 fail at their mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And what is the status of the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, {\i1}I'm{\i0} still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That alone should tell you how the others are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:13:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the one calling the shots now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Egghead is mine! All mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[♪ playful music]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you skin bags try to backstab me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I call the big gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All four Seraphim!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[high-pitched laser blasts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, about your little fleet\Nsurrounding the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You trying to start\Na war with me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We could be convinced\Nto alter our plans, York.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But let me confirm one thing first.\NCan you create the Mother Flame yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, now they want to negotiate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad I sent you that sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew you'd get hooked\Nonce you had a piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.90,Main-207+,Elder,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ELDER]\NIt is of the highest priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.51,0:13:59.86,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,{\i1}[YORK]\NWhose priority, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.86,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}Too bad! This island's the only power plant that makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here's the sitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Promise that me and the lab will make it out\Nof this thing unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:20.80,Main-207+,Elder,0,0,0,,[ELDER]\NAgreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:23.55,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,[YORK]\NAnd make me a Celestial Dragon\Nwhile you're at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:25.26,Main-207+,Elder,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ELDER]\NIt shall be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we've got ourselves a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need you to come and save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[squeaky rubber sound]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is here!\NAnd he's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.66,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.87,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,What should we do with this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No more use for her now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[crying]\NNo! No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a disaster this has been!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've caused you all such trouble, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:09.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We forgive you. But she's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, Luffy, what's the plan for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They want to keep her alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's use her as a shield when we run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's like a hostage case, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, doc. Is she gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll take time for her wounds to heal,\Nbut with plenty of rest, she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:32.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:37.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is what you choose to open with?\NWhat is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have Dr. Vegapunk!\NAll the Vegapunks even!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you wanna save York's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}life, clear all your ships\Nfrom the shore! Every last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's torturing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rumors are true! He's a menace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.86,Main-207+,Morgans,0,0,0,,[MORGANS]\NWhat is he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[wings flapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, Luffy. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That story was fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.62,Main-207+,Elder,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ELDER]\NSo you're Straw Hat Luffy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you suffered any casualties in the lab?\NWho is still there with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, let me see.\NA couple people are hurt and.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:28.47,Main-207+,St. Sheperd,0,0,0,,[ST. SHEPERD]\NA woman's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.64,Main-207+,St. Sheperd,0,0,0,,Must be Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you make me hang up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Intel is a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must never give it to your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:41.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But hey. The ships will be gone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like hell they will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think the Navy's that dumb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:50.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are three things we must protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,York's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The data stored inside Punk Records,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the power plant\Nthat creates the Mother Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything else is expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:07.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But Sir, Rob Lucci and the other Cipher Pol agents\Nare still trapped inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might face the worst case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must prioritize accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regard humans as you regard insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you exterminate\Nsome, they'll multiply again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs in resignation]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[York cries]\NYou listen\Nto me, you tiny terrorists!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made a pact with the Five Elders, you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurt me and you die!\NWhat they do to this island
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will make Ohara look like fireworks! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll sic the Elders on you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Go right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:18:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky that's all you got!\NHow dare you say that in front of Robin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your filthy mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:06.19,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NShe can't hurt us. Just ignore her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course. Have you met\Nmy doctor? He's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make me happy at all, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All things considered,\Nit was a pretty pathetic display!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though, to be fair,\NI was fighting two Seraphim at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to rest. You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cries]\NShaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:43.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you quiet down for a sec? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get in contact\Nwith the basement right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you guys hear me?\NEveryone still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[high-pitched radio noise]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:58.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[cheering]\NWe can finally eat again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:19:00.99,Main-207+,Man 2,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN 2]\NYou saved us! We were losing hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.75,Main-207+,Man 2,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.12,Main-207+,Man 2,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:08.38,Main-207+,Man 3,0,0,0,,[MAN 3]\NMan, do I love the Straw Hat crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:10.50,Main-207+,Man 4,0,0,0,,[MAN 4]\NHey, not so loud, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're still enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:14.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now is there any chance\Nhe could let us out of this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:18.35,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}[USOPP]\NI'm glad all are okay,\Nbut we really can't do that right now, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair enough, but could you relocate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's kind of nerve wracking in here\Nwith {\i1}them{\i0} around. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you guys afraid of the Seraphim?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be on the same\Nside as you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}aren't they? Yeah,\Nbut what if they go berserk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's nothing to worry about, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. They're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those bubble balls are made\Nof the same material as
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Pacifista Mk. III's Bubble Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're resilient enough\Nto deflect cannon blasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They are also created with sea energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}making them the perfect prison\Nto contain those with Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought they were just regular bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you trap me in this damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is foolish to be afraid of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We do our job. And none\Nof the Seraphim were ordered to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're of no interest to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I just feel silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}Don't mind the suits, S-Snake! They're just jumpy.\NYou're super cool in our book, after what you did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for turning us back\Nfrom stone, little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She really did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:31.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unless I made an error, that behavior\Nshould not lead her programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! Please, Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,They're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:38.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta undo this stone thing now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:41.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the only person who can save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:42.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.39,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:51.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do it! Just please stop\Nstaring at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:54.15,Main-207+,Jimbei,0,0,0,,[JIMBEI]\NOh, I see how it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.15,0:20:59.15,Main-207+,Jimbei,0,0,0,,{\q2}She's just as unmanageable as the original Hancock!\NWith the same soft spot for Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:01.41,Main-207+,Jimbei,0,0,0,,This is too funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:04.91,Main-207+,Jimbei,0,0,0,,I didn't know Seraphim worked that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:07.20,Main-207+,S-Snake,0,0,0,,[S-SNAKE]\N– Ah!\N– Oh, hi, Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How's it going? Seems\Nthe information transmitted
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}through Blood Elements\Nis broader than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:17.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were super awesome\Nback there! I owe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you just say "I love you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you just say "I love you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.56,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,[ATLAS]\NHey, Stella, we've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:36.44,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,The communication system's\Nbeen fully restored,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.32,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,but the Frontier Dome still\Nwon't open for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.20,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,[YORK]\NDon't even bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[anguished sigh]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.03,0:21:45.41,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,I protected the Dome with a passcode,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.41,0:21:47.99,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,but my brain's not synced\Nwith all of you anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm not telling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:53.79,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,[LILITH]\NAlright, I'll beat it out of you then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While all of you lose\Nyour minds, I'm gonna rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now go fetch me a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.73,0:22:06.26,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,[LILITH]\NSnack on my fist, you pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can't deactivate\Nthe barrier, we can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[whining]\NAfter all my smooth talking,\NI thought we were free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a real diplomat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:24.03,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NFour seriously injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:26.95,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Two of Vegapunk's satellites dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:29.29,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,As for the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:31.75,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,You're mumbling. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:34.58,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Just talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:41.72,Main-207+,Stussy,0,0,0,,[STUSSY]\NI checked outside and we're\Ncompletely surrounded in all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, Stussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:47.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like 100 ships.\NI'd assume there are around 30,000 Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, this is quite the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.23,0:22:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Care for a cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.23,0:22:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop glaring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Nami, correct? The crew's navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh huh, that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:06.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How does the route look?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh. The Log Pose hasn't recorded a signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:12.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we still have\None steady needle from Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.41,0:23:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems we'll be going northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:16.25,Main-207+,Doctor,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR]\NAh, that would be Elbaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.46,Main-207+,All,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Really?\N– Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:19.63,Main-207+,All,0,0,0,,We're going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:20.96,Main-207+,All,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess so. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:24.13,Main-207+,Together,0,0,0,,[TOGETHER]\NAnd what's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– The giants!\N– The giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.47,0:23:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150}Gia-gia-giants! Gia-gia-giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.81,0:23:34.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why are they so excited about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:39.65,Main-207+,Doctor,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR]\NWe do have one advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.99,0:23:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:43.11,Main-207+,Doctor,0,0,0,,Your ship is in the Labophase,\Nwithin our grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:46.61,Main-207+,Doctor,0,0,0,,The Navy ships are offshore in all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be impossible to sail under the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.57,0:23:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said that we'll be heading\Nto the northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the backside of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luckily, your ship is waiting right next\Nto the Vegaforce-01.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}With a little rocket propulsion,\Nit {\i1}should{\i0} be able to carry us clean over the Navy blockade.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.59,0:24:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the downside, Vegaforce-01\Ncan only fly within the airspace
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,over Egghead. So let's hope we get\Nenough distance before we take a Norse dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.55,0:24:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way that'll be far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.77,0:24:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}doc! You just do the best you can!\NThen the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}'s Coup de Burst will carry us the rest of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.77,0:24:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll fly a whole kilometer,\Nno way they'll catch us after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.48,0:24:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.86,0:24:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the world can your ship fly so far?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.20,0:24:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cola power Vega-bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.45,0:24:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cola power?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.32,0:24:32.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[giggles]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.00,0:24:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love it! That sounds like a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.13,0:24:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you head to Vegaforce-01 now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.13,0:24:48.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.63,0:24:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want me to move the Straw Hat's ship\Nto the backside of the island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we still can't go anywhere\Ntill we deactivate the darn Frontier Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.06,0:24:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm never gonna hand over the code!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[giggles maliciously]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.11,0:25:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll crack it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.25,0:25:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[beeps with each keystroke]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– We'll crack the pumpkin!\N– We'll crack the pumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.07,0:25:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like our plan is coming together nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.45,0:25:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet there's absolutely zero chance\Nwe pull this off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.04,0:25:23.46,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NThat's all we got.\NAnd we don't know till we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.46,0:25:25.00,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYeah, that's true enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're going to the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}, take me with!\NThat is my baby after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.34,0:25:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.47,0:25:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see Elbaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.59,0:25:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.43,0:25:37.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.60,0:25:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.34,0:25:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[♪ ethereal music]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.65,0:25:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead! It's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.34,0:25:46.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[♪ triumphant music swells]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.08,0:25:59.12,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,[LILITH]\NLet's get your ship\Nto the back side quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunting, effort sounds]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.12,0:26:01.62,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,They'll have that Frontier Dome down soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That might be good! Or it might\Njust cause even more problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.71,0:26:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.\NWhy wouldn't you want it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.09,0:26:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cause there's a catch.\NIf we can get out, the Feds can get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.55,0:26:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we're not ready to rock\Nwhen it opens, we're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.89,0:26:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.51,0:26:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun! I've never left\NEgghead! World, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.85,0:26:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, Doc! This ain't a road trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.14,0:26:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.15,0:26:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need so much more food!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.90,0:26:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd eat all of this in one day!\NDo we even have pizzas?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crack. That's super important!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to get a ton of cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.70,0:26:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we have everything else\NSanji needs to make them for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.89,0:26:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really? That guy's pretty cool, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.70,0:26:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a good cook {\i1}and{\i0} a good fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.79,0:26:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is weird! What's got you\Nin such a happy mood all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.75,0:26:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you wanted to kill Old Man Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.55,0:27:00.38,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,[BONNEY]\NYou're right, I did.\NBut I'm over that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.99,0:26:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.93,0:27:05.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good. So why\Nwere you crying all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.02,0:27:06.90,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,[BONNEY]\NHey, shut up! I was {\i1}not{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.27,0:27:10.07,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWe received\Na transmission from Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.61,0:27:13.40,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,We know the situation inside the dome now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Share it with the other ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.12,0:27:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Borsalino?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.75,0:27:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.59,0:27:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He talked a big game, but it seems he doesn't\Nhave quite as much leverage as implied.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.88,0:27:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, all of {\i1}them{\i0} are trapped\Nin that Dome like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If it uses a laser defense system, can't you simply
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pass through it? You are light itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.27,0:27:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.52,0:27:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, the barrier isn't what's stopping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.02,0:27:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a friend of mine waiting on the shore,\Nand he wants to protect Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.24,0:27:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not fly over him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.36,0:28:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can't disrespect a man who's putting everything on the line.\NI like to think I'm cooler than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.58,0:28:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the very least, let\Nme stick to my principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And remember, Sentomaru is poised\Nto attack The second we make
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.25,0:28:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}a move, he'll order every resource at his command into action.\NThat means a swarm of Sea Beast Weapons and fifty Pacifistas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.55,0:28:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bad news for all the ships we brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be committing to a massive bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.18,0:28:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We better settle this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[deep sigh]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we know where the power plant is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our friend Lucci\Nhasn't been sleeping on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.11,0:28:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have all the information we need.\NAnd he delivered it straight to our door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.50,0:28:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Prepare for battle!\N– Prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.69,0:28:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.59,0:29:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six Power Masters proceed\Nto land as soon as the battle begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.18,0:29:06.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to free\Nthe captured Cipher Pol agents!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.48,0:29:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artillery fire won't work on the Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.77,0:29:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aim all cannons at the Sea Beast Weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.37,0:29:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sure is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like on Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.17,0:29:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NI love this place too.\NBut we gotta lock in, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.55,0:29:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.89,0:29:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.60,0:29:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sacred Yata Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NHe's here. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:15.42,Main-207+,Male,0,0,0,,[MALE]\NPacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.14,0:30:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't go easy on you, Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.15,0:30:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.03,0:30:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're facing the strongest defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.70,0:30:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.83,0:30:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:30:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is this light coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.01,0:31:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.55,0:31:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone strong!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=19}===============================DIALOGUE============================
